================================================================================

MODELS

FoodMapper downloads and runs ML models on-device. No model weights are
bundled in this repository. Users download model weights at runtime.

All models use the SafeTensors format for weight storage. FoodMapper does not
load pickle files or any other serialized Python objects.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

GTE-Large (General Text Embeddings)
https://huggingface.co/richtext/foodmapper-gte-large

Source model: https://huggingface.co/thenlper/gte-large
Source revision: 4bef63f39fcc5e2d6b0aae83089f307af4970164
Artifact card revision: 200d1bf79e6a152736fe1517703d0079a0bd16fa
License: MIT License

FoodMapper bundles config.json, tokenizer.json, tokenizer_config.json,
vocab.txt, and special_tokens_map.json from the MLX conversion above. The
gte-large.safetensors model weights are not bundled and download only after
the user approves the model download. The artifact card revision updates
license metadata only. Its six payload objects retain the manifest hashes from
the historical conversion revision 0b7a78872ae6fd502fe2db3273b1b3e065a3d9db.
The GTE provenance, payload hashes, and MIT notice are in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Qwen3-Embedding (0.6B / 4B / 8B)
https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B

Apache License 2.0

Copyright (c) 2025 Alibaba Cloud / Qwen Team.

These are optional experimental Advanced downloads when shown in the app.
They are not part of the default local embedding path and have not been
qualified for research use. Refer to the source model card and conversion
repository for the exact artifact terms.

